{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_22770","headline":"得微之到官後书备知通州之事怅然有感因成四章 一 · 白居易","name":"得微之到官後书备知通州之事怅然有感因成四章 一","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"来书子细说通州，州在山根峡岸头。\n四面千重火云合，中心一道瘴江流。\n虫蛇白昼拦官道，蚊蚋黄昏扑郡楼。\n何罪遣君居此地，天高无处问来由。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"白居易","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_22770.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_22770","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}